# /etc/systemd/system/botsbank-llm.service
# IBM Granite 3.3 2B served by llama.cpp, local only (127.0.0.1:8080).
[Unit]
Description=Bots Bank - IBM Granite model (llama.cpp)
After=network.target

[Service]
User=linux1
ExecStart=/home/linux1/llama.cpp/build/bin/llama-server -m /home/linux1/models/granite-3.3-2b-instruct-Q8_0.gguf --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080 -c 4096 -t 3
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5
# Basic hardening: no privilege gain, private /tmp, system folders read-only.
NoNewPrivileges=yes
PrivateTmp=yes
ProtectSystem=full

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
